A personal Data Analytics project focused on analyzing Toyota sales data. The project covers data preparation, database management, sales analysis, and dashboard visualization.

* SQL / SQLite
* Microsoft Excel
* Power BI
* Data Analysis
* Data Visualization

The project analyzes:

* Sales performance
* Revenue
* Discounts
* Car models
* Customers
* Sales staff
* Inventory

Data Collection → Data Cleaning → SQL Analysis → Data Visualization → Dashboard

Power BI Dashboard was created to visualize sales performance, revenue, and other key insights from the dataset.

Database/    → SQLite database
Excel/       → Excel data
PowerBI/     → Power BI dashboard
SQL/         → SQL queries
Dashboard/   → Dashboard screenshots
